@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

state "Registration" as Registration
Registration : entry / New user
Registration : do / Enter details
Registration : exit / Registration successful

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / Registered user
Login : do / Enter credentials
Login : exit / Login successful

state "Access Granted" as AccessGranted
AccessGranted : entry / Login successful
AccessGranted : do / Provide access to facilities
AccessGranted : exit / User interaction

state "News and Content" as NewsContent
NewsContent : entry / User interaction
NewsContent : do / Display news and content
NewsContent : exit / User continues or finishes

state "Health Information" as HealthInfo
HealthInfo : entry / User interaction
HealthInfo : do / Provide health information
HealthInfo : exit / User continues or finishes

state "Payment Processing" as PaymentProcessing
PaymentProcessing : entry / User interaction
PaymentProcessing : do / Process insurance or payment
PaymentProcessing : exit / Payment complete

state "Feedback Collection" as FeedbackCollection
FeedbackCollection : entry / Service completion
FeedbackCollection : do / Collect user feedback
FeedbackCollection : exit / Feedback submitted

state "Logout" as Logout
Logout : entry / User interaction
Logout : do / Log out user
Logout : exit / Session ended

[*] --> Registration
Registration --> Login : Registration successful
Login --> AccessGranted : Login successful
AccessGranted --> NewsContent : User interaction
AccessGranted --> HealthInfo : User interaction
AccessGranted --> PaymentProcessing : User interaction
AccessGranted --> FeedbackCollection : Service completion
AccessGranted --> Logout : User interaction

NewsContent --> AccessGranted : User continues or finishes
HealthInfo --> AccessGranted : User continues or finishes
PaymentProcessing --> AccessGranted : Payment complete
FeedbackCollection --> AccessGranted : Feedback submitted
Logout --> [*]
@enduml
